  <trk>
    <name>Cycling route Zgornje Jezersko–Ankova planina–Zgornje Jezersko</name>
    <desc>Another scenic lake route that will not leave even the more demanding view seeker indifferent. / Zgornje Jezersko–source of mineral water &quot;Jezerska slatina&quot;–Jezerski vrh–Ankova planina–Jezerski vrh–Church of St. Andrew–Šenkova farmhouse–Planšarsko lake–Zgornje Jezersko</desc>
